{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"本质几何态射"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"本质几何态射"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"之间的<strong>本质几何态射</strong> (essential geometric morphism) 是满足拉回函子有进一步左伴随的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n(f_! \\dashv f^* \\dashv f_*)\\colon \\mathcal F \\to \\mathcal E.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}